The XBoard manual (including version.texi, which it depends upon), should be
automatically generated by XBoard's standard build procedure.

Periodically, however, a maintainer should retrieve the latest versions of the
following files from the gnulib repo:
  - gendocs.sh
  - gendocs_template

Sample command: TEX=tex ./gendocs.sh --email bug-xboard@gnu.org xboard "GNU XBoard manual"
